(5630088, 818363, 27161, '<td valign="top">That is quite an interesting shot.  The patterns in the ice are eye-catching. I haven''t quite seen it before.  Remember to properly face your labels.  If you can show more of the big label and less of the bar code it will be more appealing.  Perhaps if you had a different background color (white or blue) the signature red coke label will be better displayed.  Congrats overall.</td>', 'That is quite an interesting shot.  The patterns in the ice are eye-catching. I haven''t quite seen it before.  Remember to properly face your labels.  If you can show more of the big label and less of the bar code it will be more appealing.  Perhaps if you had a different background color (white or blue) the signature red coke label will be better displayed.  Congrats overall.', '2009-09-01 01:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630090, 818318, 27161, '<td valign="top">The textures and mood of this photo are very interesting.  I haven''t seen this in a wedding photo before.  Although, I am no fan of wedding photos in general, but this tells a slightly more interesting story.  It almost looks old-fashioned.  Great job.</td>', 'The textures and mood of this photo are very interesting.  I haven''t seen this in a wedding photo before.  Although, I am no fan of wedding photos in general, but this tells a slightly more interesting story.  It almost looks old-fashioned.  Great job.', '2009-09-01 01:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
