(5630096, 817129, 65858, '<td valign="top">Too cute!</td>', 'Too cute!', '2009-09-01 01:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630097, 818215, 27161, '<td valign="top">Great framing. I''m guessing you had to take this in low light with a shallow DOF.  I''m guessing you had to bring out the details and hide the noise.  Although I could be wrong.  For those circumstances I''d say you did a great job and made a great capture.</td>', 'Great framing. I''m guessing you had to take this in low light with a shallow DOF.  I''m guessing you had to bring out the details and hide the noise.  Although I could be wrong.  For those circumstances I''d say you did a great job and made a great capture.', '2009-09-01 01:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
