(5630178, 814329, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, first cab off the rank and it''s this beauty. Great choice. You certainly nailed the sweet spot in the right place on those crashing waves. Awesome timing and control. Plus including the kids in frame has really given it scale. How they weren''t all swept away is beyond me.</td>', 'Oh yeah, first cab off the rank and it''s this beauty. Great choice. You certainly nailed the sweet spot in the right place on those crashing waves. Awesome timing and control. Plus including the kids in frame has really given it scale. How they weren''t all swept away is beyond me.', '2009-09-01 02:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
