(5630181, 818268, 75713, '<td valign="top">To begin, your model is adorable ... this is a perfect example of where the pure whites enhance the image rather than making you think something is "blown" in the photograph...... the b/g is perfect, the image just glows ... her expression is ambiguous which I like.. a 9 from me</td>', 'To begin, your model is adorable ... this is a perfect example of where the pure whites enhance the image rather than making you think something is "blown" in the photograph...... the b/g is perfect, the image just glows ... her expression is ambiguous which I like.. a 9 from me', '2009-09-01 02:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630182, 818303, 75713, '<td valign="top">This photo is interesting.. what is that thing in the field?  A time machine?  The sky is wonderfully dramatic and an example of the few times I find black and white and blue in a sky acceptable ... nicely photographed and an interesting composition.</td>', 'This photo is interesting.. what is that thing in the field?  A time machine?  The sky is wonderfully dramatic and an example of the few times I find black and white and blue in a sky acceptable ... nicely photographed and an interesting composition.', '2009-09-01 02:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
