(5630354, 817735, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, pleasing soft lighting.  Face and eyes are very crisp.</td>', 'Nice portrait, pleasing soft lighting.  Face and eyes are very crisp.', '2009-09-01 07:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630361, 818336, 103032, '<td valign="top">Composition isn''t pleasing.  The heron(?) is too centered, the flower blocks the center of the bird.  Might have tried stepping to your left to compose the flowers off the bird.  Since the bird is looking to the left, may have tried to compose the bird to the right a bit more (rule of thirds), so that the bird is looking into the frame.  IMHO.  On a positive note, you captured great texture and color of the feathers and the eye and beak.</td>', 'Composition isn''t pleasing.  The heron(?) is too centered, the flower blocks the center of the bird.  Might have tried stepping to your left to compose the flowers off the bird.  Since the bird is looking to the left, may have tried to compose the bird to the right a bit more (rule of thirds), so that the bird is looking into the frame.  IMHO.  On a positive note, you captured great texture and color of the feathers and the eye and beak.', '2009-09-01 07:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630363, 814575, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection shot.  However, the greens look muted.  Maybe a bump in saturation to "brighten" up the greens?</td>', 'Nice reflection shot.  However, the greens look muted.  Maybe a bump in saturation to "brighten" up the greens?', '2009-09-01 07:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630366, 818411, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern with the horses and stall doors.  Like the DOF.  The front (main) horse has nice visual interest with it''s mouth open, gives the impression that it is barking orders to the other horses.  Nicely composed.  I think others on DPC will critique the "overexposed" stall doors, but not not a big deal in the overall subject matter.</td>', 'Nice pattern with the horses and stall doors.  Like the DOF.  The front (main) horse has nice visual interest with it''s mouth open, gives the impression that it is barking orders to the other horses.  Nicely composed.  I think others on DPC will critique the "overexposed" stall doors, but not not a big deal in the overall subject matter.', '2009-09-01 08:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630367, 818355, 103032, '<td valign="top">Maybe a portrait orientation instead of the landscape orientation would have made this a better portrait.  As is it''s a nice portrait, but I think you may get critiqued that it''s too centered, leaving a lot of dead space to the right and the space on the left may be distracting even though you have good DOF blur.</td>', 'Maybe a portrait orientation instead of the landscape orientation would have made this a better portrait.  As is it''s a nice portrait, but I think you may get critiqued that it''s too centered, leaving a lot of dead space to the right and the space on the left may be distracting even though you have good DOF blur.', '2009-09-01 08:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
