(5631336, 817169, 88501, '<td valign="top">I like this but like many of mine I''d prefer if you would have backed away or gone with a wider angle on it if possible to show more... all my waterfall pics from Yosemmite were like this and I wished I did what I just told you as well - still nice and a 6</td>', 'I like this but like many of mine I''d prefer if you would have backed away or gone with a wider angle on it if possible to show more... all my waterfall pics from Yosemmite were like this and I wished I did what I just told you as well - still nice and a 6', '2009-09-01 20:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
