(5633892, 816631, 99263, '<td valign="top">Heck this looks like a place in South Africa somewhere....Ive been through there and I think it''s somewhere in the Orange Free State close to the Cape Province border if I am not mistaken. But I might be wrong...it''s been a long time since I was in that country. Nice shot by the way and I like the processing. Baie mooi.</td>', 'Heck this looks like a place in South Africa somewhere....Ive been through there and I think it''s somewhere in the Orange Free State close to the Cape Province border if I am not mistaken. But I might be wrong...it''s been a long time since I was in that country. Nice shot by the way and I like the processing. Baie mooi.', '2009-09-03 03:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5633893, 818296, 75713, '<td valign="top">even her skin tones make her look cold ... hope you tell us how this shot was accomplished ... crisp, interesting amd a story I would like to hear</td>', 'even her skin tones make her look cold ... hope you tell us how this shot was accomplished ... crisp, interesting amd a story I would like to hear', '2009-09-03 03:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5633895, 818389, 75713, '<td valign="top">OK I wonder .. were you close to shore and got this shot ....... or in a boat close by? Either way, nicely photographed!</td>', 'OK I wonder .. were you close to shore and got this shot ....... or in a boat close by? Either way, nicely photographed!', '2009-09-03 03:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5633896, 818496, 75713, '<td valign="top">Not much money in his guitar case... hope you added some (grin) .... interesting in that he puts his name out there ....... was he any good?  BTW, nicely photographed.</td>', 'Not much money in his guitar case... hope you added some (grin) .... interesting in that he puts his name out there ....... was he any good?  BTW, nicely photographed.', '2009-09-03 03:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5633897, 818269, 75713, '<td valign="top">Sand dunes make me feel calm ... gentle inside.. this one is well done ... will have to add it to my favs so I can feel peaceful when needed.</td>', 'Sand dunes make me feel calm ... gentle inside.. this one is well done ... will have to add it to my favs so I can feel peaceful when needed.', '2009-09-03 03:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
