(5636292, 818510, 24486, '<td valign="top">Great capture of emotion &amp; it looks like she is going really fast.</td>', 'Great capture of emotion & it looks like she is going really fast.', '2009-09-04 22:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636300, 811833, 24486, '<td valign="top">I would imagine that photograph didn''t come easily. Very nicely captured.</td>', 'I would imagine that photograph didn''t come easily. Very nicely captured.', '2009-09-04 22:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636302, 817903, 24486, '<td valign="top">I envy your opportunity to take photographs like this.</td>', 'I envy your opportunity to take photographs like this.', '2009-09-04 22:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636305, 817235, 24486, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of the frame but the whole flipping the reflection idea is really good &amp; quite eye catching.</td>', 'I am not a fan of the frame but the whole flipping the reflection idea is really good & quite eye catching.', '2009-09-04 22:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636320, 817761, 70369, '<td valign="top">I never look at the title of the image until I vote, and I immediately thought of Clockwork..</td>', 'I never look at the title of the image until I vote, and I immediately thought of Clockwork..', '2009-09-04 23:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636323, 818199, 70369, '<td valign="top">awesome detail.</td>', 'awesome detail.', '2009-09-04 23:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636324, 816953, 70369, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2009-09-04 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636328, 817238, 81362, '<td valign="top">Diagonal shoreline is nice. Dark clouds add interest. Tilt of horizon throws it off and could be corrected under the editing rules. Fill flash might have helped bring out the faces better and would help diminish the sense of underexposure. Pose less square to the camera could be more flattering.</td>', 'Diagonal shoreline is nice. Dark clouds add interest. Tilt of horizon throws it off and could be corrected under the editing rules. Fill flash might have helped bring out the faces better and would help diminish the sense of underexposure. Pose less square to the camera could be more flattering.', '2009-09-04 23:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636330, 817373, 81362, '<td valign="top">Cute child. Square crop might bring more attention to the face and help remove the distracting plastic arc in left lower corner. Color balance adjustment reducing yellow-orange cast could help.</td>', 'Cute child. Square crop might bring more attention to the face and help remove the distracting plastic arc in left lower corner. Color balance adjustment reducing yellow-orange cast could help.', '2009-09-04 23:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636334, 816294, 30049, '<td valign="top">Man.  If you had used the full 720 I''d give it a 10, but it''s still sweet enough for a 9!  Good luck.</td>', 'Man.  If you had used the full 720 I''d give it a 10, but it''s still sweet enough for a 9!  Good luck.', '2009-09-04 23:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636336, 816534, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice heart made by the thumbs and fingers but easy to miss with the cleavage being adjacent and more in focus. Smile sweet with a hint of misbehavior.</td>', 'Nice heart made by the thumbs and fingers but easy to miss with the cleavage being adjacent and more in focus. Smile sweet with a hint of misbehavior.', '2009-09-04 23:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636337, 818479, 81362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. White background still separates nicely from white horse. Combination ends up with quite an exotic feeling, maybe because we have no context to limit imagination.</td>', 'Beautiful image. White background still separates nicely from white horse. Combination ends up with quite an exotic feeling, maybe because we have no context to limit imagination.', '2009-09-04 23:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636338, 817756, 81362, '<td valign="top">This treatment really brings out the layers of petals. Beautiful approach that helps us see in a new way.</td>', 'This treatment really brings out the layers of petals. Beautiful approach that helps us see in a new way.', '2009-09-04 23:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636340, 817316, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and nice B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'Good lighting and nice B&W conversion.', '2009-09-04 23:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636342, 815477, 81362, '<td valign="top">Really communicates a sense of motion. Orange tones work well with blue-grey sky.</td>', 'Really communicates a sense of motion. Orange tones work well with blue-grey sky.', '2009-09-04 23:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636343, 814387, 81362, '<td valign="top">High amount of "wow" factor. Should score well.</td>', 'High amount of "wow" factor. Should score well.', '2009-09-04 23:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636344, 816784, 102890, '<td valign="top">Whew!  This is absolutely Gorgeous!!!</td>', 'Whew!  This is absolutely Gorgeous!!!', '2009-09-04 23:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636370, 817361, 62895, '<td valign="top">Great shot and really sharp focus, it just needs a bit more contrast. That would take this from good to stunning.</td>', 'Great shot and really sharp focus, it just needs a bit more contrast. That would take this from good to stunning.', '2009-09-05 00:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636387, 816511, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  Great with the sun peeking through and the star effect!   You had great clouds too; the light in the sky has great subtle variations and is fantastic.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  Great with the sun peeking through and the star effect!   You had great clouds too; the light in the sky has great subtle variations and is fantastic.', '2009-09-05 00:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636403, 818370, 62895, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Some amazing symmetry, geometry, and perspective in this shot. Processing is superb as well.</td>', 'Excellent! Some amazing symmetry, geometry, and perspective in this shot. Processing is superb as well.', '2009-09-05 00:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636405, 815450, 62895, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! This could be a painting, the colors are perfect the focus is sharp and yet kind of soft at the same time, the glow on the rocks and house are perfect. One of my two 10''s in the challenge. I hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Wow!!! This could be a painting, the colors are perfect the focus is sharp and yet kind of soft at the same time, the glow on the rocks and house are perfect. One of my two 10''s in the challenge. I hope this ribbons.', '2009-09-05 00:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636407, 817280, 62895, '<td valign="top">Great movement and excitement in this photo. 9</td>', 'Great movement and excitement in this photo. 9', '2009-09-05 00:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636408, 818312, 62895, '<td valign="top">So open and free, great colors. In my top 10. 9</td>', 'So open and free, great colors. In my top 10. 9', '2009-09-05 00:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636409, 816294, 62895, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting, this is fantastic. 9</td>', 'Looks like a painting, this is fantastic. 9', '2009-09-05 00:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636410, 818513, 62895, '<td valign="top">Stunning! I love the blue glowing rivulets. Plus, I''m a big waterfall fan. 9</td>', 'Stunning! I love the blue glowing rivulets. Plus, I''m a big waterfall fan. 9', '2009-09-05 00:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636412, 818231, 62895, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I think this type of shot is overdone on DPC, but I''ve got to hand it to you. This is a really great portrait. Lots of character and detail. 9</td>', 'Sometimes I think this type of shot is overdone on DPC, but I''ve got to hand it to you. This is a really great portrait. Lots of character and detail. 9', '2009-09-05 00:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636414, 816339, 62895, '<td valign="top">Some might think this looks over processed, but I really like the effect. Great work. 8</td>', 'Some might think this looks over processed, but I really like the effect. Great work. 8', '2009-09-05 00:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636418, 817446, 62895, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting. IMO a lot of people do photos of plants because they''re easy and many of them are just boring, but this is fantastic. It looks very painterly. I like the unique angle and vibrant greens and yellows. Great job!</td>', 'Looks like a painting. IMO a lot of people do photos of plants because they''re easy and many of them are just boring, but this is fantastic. It looks very painterly. I like the unique angle and vibrant greens and yellows. Great job!', '2009-09-05 00:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636421, 817118, 62895, '<td valign="top">Great feel to this photo. I like the contrast of sunny and cloudy.</td>', 'Great feel to this photo. I like the contrast of sunny and cloudy.', '2009-09-05 00:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636422, 818161, 62895, '<td valign="top">Great textures and depth. I would love to do a portrait shoot in a place like this. :-) 8</td>', 'Great textures and depth. I would love to do a portrait shoot in a place like this. :-) 8', '2009-09-05 00:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636425, 818264, 62895, '<td valign="top">So smooth and pretty. I like the randomness of the rocks as well.</td>', 'So smooth and pretty. I like the randomness of the rocks as well.', '2009-09-05 00:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636427, 818376, 62895, '<td valign="top">Chrome...very nice.</td>', 'Chrome...very nice.', '2009-09-05 00:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636429, 817974, 62895, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp, great clarity and vibrancy.</td>', 'Tack sharp, great clarity and vibrancy.', '2009-09-05 00:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636430, 815758, 62895, '<td valign="top">This is very unique. I like the light in the background, it adds to the otherworldly effect.</td>', 'This is very unique. I like the light in the background, it adds to the otherworldly effect.', '2009-09-05 00:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636431, 814840, 62895, '<td valign="top">Great motion in this photo. The processing helps it as well, giving it more mystery. Powerful image.</td>', 'Great motion in this photo. The processing helps it as well, giving it more mystery. Powerful image.', '2009-09-05 00:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636432, 818294, 62895, '<td valign="top">This would be great as a large print!</td>', 'This would be great as a large print!', '2009-09-05 00:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
