(5638418, 818318, 76335, '<td valign="top">This has an unsettling, forboding quality. She, at least, looks distracted, and neither looks happy. The low key treatment adds to the dark, ominous mood. I like it for those reasons, actually, but I''m not sure if that''s what you had in mind.</td>', 'This has an unsettling, forboding quality. She, at least, looks distracted, and neither looks happy. The low key treatment adds to the dark, ominous mood. I like it for those reasons, actually, but I''m not sure if that''s what you had in mind.', '2009-09-06 23:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
