(5638422, 818498, 76335, '<td valign="top">I wish you had given it a more ambiguous title. The picture is great and should be left to the viewer''s imagination (it''s a book of spells!). But the title reduces it to a poorly executed snapshot.</td>', 'I wish you had given it a more ambiguous title. The picture is great and should be left to the viewer''s imagination (it''s a book of spells!). But the title reduces it to a poorly executed snapshot.', '2009-09-06 23:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5638430, 814329, 76335, '<td valign="top">The kids are easy to miss. They almost blend in with the posts. When they do reveal themselves to the viewer (as kids, not posts), it''s quite a nice surprise. <br/> <br/>Great job with the composition and using the contrast and lighting to maximum effect. Just enough information is revealed. Moving from left to right, you see the children having fun, then the posts and a little more splash, then at the far right of the frame, complete shadowy, blurry chaos. Quite a range of dynamics and a nice progression. <br/> <br/>Is this a Lensbaby? <br/> <br/>My pick of the challenge, I think. Ten.</td>', 'The kids are easy to miss. They almost blend in with the posts. When they do reveal themselves to the viewer (as kids, not posts), it''s quite a nice surprise.  Great job with the composition and using the contrast and lighting to maximum effect. Just enough information is revealed. Moving from left to right, you see the children having fun, then the posts and a little more splash, then at the far right of the frame, complete shadowy, blurry chaos. Quite a range of dynamics and a nice progression.  Is this a Lensbaby?  My pick of the challenge, I think. Ten.', '2009-09-06 23:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
