(5639119, 815676, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks good at 1x, looks good here. I like the way that you balanced fun with exhaustion. A long day of hard play comes to a tiring end. A great summertime moment. I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Looks good at 1x, looks good here. I like the way that you balanced fun with exhaustion. A long day of hard play comes to a tiring end. A great summertime moment. I hope it does well for you.', '2009-09-07 14:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
