(5639215, 812846, 88247, '<td valign="top">The right place at the right time!!<br/>Love the softness and the delicate colours in this shot and of course you managed to find some Ladybirds which makes this shot more beautiful:-)</td>', 'The right place at the right time!!Love the softness and the delicate colours in this shot and of course you managed to find some Ladybirds which makes this shot more beautiful:-)', '2009-09-07 16:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
