(5639246, 818336, 7786, '<td valign="top">The captured bird looks nice but the intruding flowers are very distracting. Having the bird a little more to the left and with the flower not overlapping would have made a huge difference.</td>', 'The captured bird looks nice but the intruding flowers are very distracting. Having the bird a little more to the left and with the flower not overlapping would have made a huge difference.', '2009-09-07 17:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
