(5639688, 818318, 50695, '<td valign="top">Something is wrong. It could have been a split second of discord, but you captured it perfectly, and with this processing you''ve enshrined it. For disturbing me this much, I give you my Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Something is wrong. It could have been a split second of discord, but you captured it perfectly, and with this processing you''ve enshrined it. For disturbing me this much, I give you my Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2009-09-07 23:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639705, 817235, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve got two brilliant examples of high-contrast black and white with excellent rich shadows, so I give each one a yellow ribbon. Here''s one for you:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I''ve got two brilliant examples of high-contrast black and white with excellent rich shadows, so I give each one a yellow ribbon. Here''s one for you: ', '2009-09-08 00:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639709, 814329, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve got two brilliant examples of high-contrast black and white with excellent rich shadows, so I give each one a yellow ribbon. Here''s one for you:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>Am interested to hear how you created this effect.</td>', 'I''ve got two brilliant examples of high-contrast black and white with excellent rich shadows, so I give each one a yellow ribbon. Here''s one for you:   Am interested to hear how you created this effect.', '2009-09-08 00:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639710, 816476, 50695, '<td valign="top">This photo is a subtle perfection of elements. The pastel tones present the right emphasis for the closed pink areas of mouth and eyes, the clouds pick up the white of the horse, the composition emphasizing the horse''s head, giving it a disturbing prominence, the angle that makes the mane look like hair. Even the power lines serve to make the simple composition more interesting. Oddly, disturbingly perfect. And the title fits as well, suggesting a deep sort of beauty that transcends cycles of birth and death. I give you my Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This photo is a subtle perfection of elements. The pastel tones present the right emphasis for the closed pink areas of mouth and eyes, the clouds pick up the white of the horse, the composition emphasizing the horse''s head, giving it a disturbing prominence, the angle that makes the mane look like hair. Even the power lines serve to make the simple composition more interesting. Oddly, disturbingly perfect. And the title fits as well, suggesting a deep sort of beauty that transcends cycles of birth and death. I give you my Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-09-08 00:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
