(5640032, 817235, 30214, '<td valign="top">wow, congrats Nick! Must be the first time when a street shot wins a ribbon in FS! it is a rare case when reflection is more clear than the "original", because the couple in the reflection is perched against the light sky and in the original they are almost lost against the dark wall</td>', 'wow, congrats Nick! Must be the first time when a street shot wins a ribbon in FS! it is a rare case when reflection is more clear than the "original", because the couple in the reflection is perched against the light sky and in the original they are almost lost against the dark wall', '2009-09-08 03:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640033, 816511, 31637, '<td valign="top">What a place!, and love the color. Clouds could really add another dimension to the sky, not a big fan of the sun burst in this case since it overlaps the rocks, just my opinion, great shot.</td>', 'What a place!, and love the color. Clouds could really add another dimension to the sky, not a big fan of the sun burst in this case since it overlaps the rocks, just my opinion, great shot.', '2009-09-08 03:42:24.000000', NULL, 0),
