(5640128, 817276, 69776, '<td valign="top">For me the action feels too far away, its definitely over sharpened &amp; has a slight cartoonish feel to it which I don''t think goes over too well. Better isolation of the boat could improve it, perhaps even a tight crop around the boat &amp; bridge could have been better.</td>', 'For me the action feels too far away, its definitely over sharpened & has a slight cartoonish feel to it which I don''t think goes over too well. Better isolation of the boat could improve it, perhaps even a tight crop around the boat & bridge could have been better.', '2009-09-08 06:49:12.000000', NULL, 0),
