(5640133, 818268, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwiness:</b></div><hr/><i> This is one of your better shots so far. I hope you are finally away from that hardcore filter/plug in phase you have been going through the last year or two. This kind of image has much much more impact. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>But Gary.... there''s an HDR challenge next!!!! LMAO<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-08 10:21:39.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by kiwiness: This is one of your better shots so far. I hope you are finally away from that hardcore filter/plug in phase you have been going through the last year or two. This kind of image has much much more impact.   But Gary.... there''s an HDR challenge next!!!! LMAO ', '2009-09-08 07:13:27.000000', '2009-09-08 11:21:39.000000', 0),
