(5640150, 817276, 7889, '<td valign="top">Free studies are hard! I gave this a 6, would have expected it to score much higher than it did. I agree it does not have the ''wow'' factor, which is needed for a high FS finish. Dont be disheartened by the low vote, DPC members are very hard to please !<br/></td>', 'Free studies are hard! I gave this a 6, would have expected it to score much higher than it did. I agree it does not have the ''wow'' factor, which is needed for a high FS finish. Dont be disheartened by the low vote, DPC members are very hard to please !', '2009-09-08 07:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
