(5640155, 818302, 7786, '<td valign="top">Just to explain my shot: it has limited editing. After simple RAW converton I did some dodge/burn on the waterfall and some color adjustments plus noise reduction because of the noisy long exposure. Other than that the editing is minimal, using a flashlight and long exposure was what made this image as it is.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments, they are helpfull in a way that its not good to post an image that looks overprocessed even if it is not.<br/> <br/>Örvar<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-08 07:09:31.</i></td>', 'Just to explain my shot: it has limited editing. After simple RAW converton I did some dodge/burn on the waterfall and some color adjustments plus noise reduction because of the noisy long exposure. Other than that the editing is minimal, using a flashlight and long exposure was what made this image as it is. Thanks for the comments, they are helpfull in a way that its not good to post an image that looks overprocessed even if it is not. Örvar', '2009-09-08 08:08:34.000000', '2009-09-08 08:09:31.000000', 0),
