(5640185, 816650, 30982, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, based on my preferences, this would be a much stronger shot without the blue but that''s because I''m not a big fan of the partial desat thing.  I love the odd angle and the flowers above her head to echo the one in her hair.  She has a great expression.  Minor nit - clone the white petal on the lower left on the ground and MAYBE give it just a bit more contrast, but not too much.  I quite like the shot - quirky and fun!</td>', 'In my opinion, based on my preferences, this would be a much stronger shot without the blue but that''s because I''m not a big fan of the partial desat thing.  I love the odd angle and the flowers above her head to echo the one in her hair.  She has a great expression.  Minor nit - clone the white petal on the lower left on the ground and MAYBE give it just a bit more contrast, but not too much.  I quite like the shot - quirky and fun!', '2009-09-08 08:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
