(5640215, 817903, 80904, '<td valign="top">This one had potential with a tighter crop around the bear. If it were possible I would also do some highlights/shadows on the bear to see more detail on him/her. The bear seems a bit dark in contrast to the rest of the photo which makes the eye want to look for something else in the photo.</td>', 'This one had potential with a tighter crop around the bear. If it were possible I would also do some highlights/shadows on the bear to see more detail on him/her. The bear seems a bit dark in contrast to the rest of the photo which makes the eye want to look for something else in the photo.', '2009-09-08 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
