(5640239, 816650, 106806, '<td valign="top">flower blown, eyes too blue though I think you are right keeping them in colour is a good thing. Execution wise thats my opinion but that is matter of taste rather than pure technical judgement.<br/> <br/>Everything else I think is good, its good composition and the emotion is haunting.<br/> <br/>You probably scored lower in this because of the selective desaturation I''m guessing folks who like the image composition and would have scored it 6  or 7 dropped a mark. <br/> <br/>If I had voted (and I don''t in challenged I''ve entered) I would have given it 7 then maybe bumped it to 8 if I wanted it to win.</td>', 'flower blown, eyes too blue though I think you are right keeping them in colour is a good thing. Execution wise thats my opinion but that is matter of taste rather than pure technical judgement. Everything else I think is good, its good composition and the emotion is haunting. You probably scored lower in this because of the selective desaturation I''m guessing folks who like the image composition and would have scored it 6  or 7 dropped a mark.  If I had voted (and I don''t in challenged I''ve entered) I would have given it 7 then maybe bumped it to 8 if I wanted it to win.', '2009-09-08 09:33:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640243, 818415, 106806, '<td valign="top">Would have been better as a pure silhouette and possibly cropped a bit more of the sky out. Longer DOF with some sharpening. It would never have won a ribbon its to different (and I like that) but maybe would have scored higher. DPC certainly encourages excellence but I''m not convinved that it encourages artistic inovation.</td>', 'Would have been better as a pure silhouette and possibly cropped a bit more of the sky out. Longer DOF with some sharpening. It would never have won a ribbon its to different (and I like that) but maybe would have scored higher. DPC certainly encourages excellence but I''m not convinved that it encourages artistic inovation.', '2009-09-08 09:36:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640244, 817864, 72670, '<td valign="top">Love the whole concept, processing and execution. Hope to see more of this stuff around here.</td>', 'Love the whole concept, processing and execution. Hope to see more of this stuff around here.', '2009-09-08 09:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
