(5640321, 814359, 106806, '<td valign="top">Well colour wise I quite like it. Coming at it from the point of view of "why no comments" and "why so average" ..... I just think its a matter of competition context. In a free for all its not exactly an uplifting specimen to look at. In a named category such as "The last" or "end" I suspect you would have done a lot better. I don''t find the daisy on the right adds much to the picture except where viewed in the context of the caption. If I''d voted (and I don''t in challenges I enter, not until I can consitently get 6 or above) I would have probably given it a 6.</td>', 'Well colour wise I quite like it. Coming at it from the point of view of "why no comments" and "why so average" ..... I just think its a matter of competition context. In a free for all its not exactly an uplifting specimen to look at. In a named category such as "The last" or "end" I suspect you would have done a lot better. I don''t find the daisy on the right adds much to the picture except where viewed in the context of the caption. If I''d voted (and I don''t in challenges I enter, not until I can consitently get 6 or above) I would have probably given it a 6.', '2009-09-08 10:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
