(5640357, 817276, 7743, '<td valign="top">There is a subtle V that could be a leading line however feel it''s not strong enough to carry the image.  Possibly cropping to square so the bridge is in the bottom left would help with the dynamics of the image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-08 09:55:20.</i></td>', 'There is a subtle V that could be a leading line however feel it''s not strong enough to carry the image.  Possibly cropping to square so the bridge is in the bottom left would help with the dynamics of the image.', '2009-09-08 10:54:57.000000', '2009-09-08 10:55:20.000000', 0),
