(5640433, 818383, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the C Club<br/> <br/>I am sitting here giggling!!!<br/> <br/>She looks like she is a ton of fun, really I am giggling when I see this shot, the look in her eyes is priceless.<br/> <br/>This is one of those photos that is hard to critique as there is not a lot I can suggest. Your sharpness is great, your colours are brilliant, your POV is hilarious, DOF is spot on.<br/> <br/>I love it, well done!</td>', 'Hi from the C Club I am sitting here giggling!!! She looks like she is a ton of fun, really I am giggling when I see this shot, the look in her eyes is priceless. This is one of those photos that is hard to critique as there is not a lot I can suggest. Your sharpness is great, your colours are brilliant, your POV is hilarious, DOF is spot on. I love it, well done!', '2009-09-08 12:14:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640436, 817623, 101678, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular.... minus the monitor thing :)  I remember seeing a forum post about this image, but didn''t know that it was you!  Looks like you worked the fog really nicely.  I have to laugh when you talk about not getting "mm767cap" type quality images and then I look at your scores.  I''ve got exactly 1 image above a 7, and that was barely.  Then I look at YOUR portfolio!!!!!  :)  Beautiful work as always.</td>', 'This is spectacular.... minus the monitor thing :)  I remember seeing a forum post about this image, but didn''t know that it was you!  Looks like you worked the fog really nicely.  I have to laugh when you talk about not getting "mm767cap" type quality images and then I look at your scores.  I''ve got exactly 1 image above a 7, and that was barely.  Then I look at YOUR portfolio!!!!!  :)  Beautiful work as always.', '2009-09-08 12:19:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640437, 817235, 68947, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon!  Beautiful comp!<br/> <br/>I''m amazed at how the reflection shows a building behind the men but, it''s not behind them in the top portion of the shot??  You have me puzzled so, perhaps, you can share your process with us???  Congrats!!<br/> <br/>ETA:  Ahhhh.....nevermind telling us how you did it! LOL  I just flipped my laptop upside down ROFL to see that you rotated the shot upside down.  DUHHHH! LOL  Really great idea and very clever because it gave a great effect! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-08 11:25:59.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon!  Beautiful comp! I''m amazed at how the reflection shows a building behind the men but, it''s not behind them in the top portion of the shot??  You have me puzzled so, perhaps, you can share your process with us???  Congrats!! ETA:  Ahhhh.....nevermind telling us how you did it! LOL  I just flipped my laptop upside down ROFL to see that you rotated the shot upside down.  DUHHHH! LOL  Really great idea and very clever because it gave a great effect! :)', '2009-09-08 12:21:26.000000', '2009-09-08 12:25:59.000000', 0),
(5640442, 816121, 53094, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be yours, Anni.  Beautiful photo, with great color &amp; composition.</td>', 'I thought this might be yours, Anni.  Beautiful photo, with great color & composition.', '2009-09-08 12:26:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640444, 816808, 69008, '<td valign="top">Many people probably mistook this for a blue jay in the thumb view, and passed over it in voting.  There are a couple of spots, the cheek and the one wing coverlet where the white is almost washed out as you mentioned in your comment.  I am not sure how the color saturation is supposed to look on the bird, as I don''t think that I have ever seen one in the wild. The bokeh is very nice, and focus/detail is also spot on.</td>', 'Many people probably mistook this for a blue jay in the thumb view, and passed over it in voting.  There are a couple of spots, the cheek and the one wing coverlet where the white is almost washed out as you mentioned in your comment.  I am not sure how the color saturation is supposed to look on the bird, as I don''t think that I have ever seen one in the wild. The bokeh is very nice, and focus/detail is also spot on.', '2009-09-08 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640445, 815450, 68947, '<td valign="top">A really beautiful shot and I''m sure a memory that will be framed in honor of your aunt!  Congratulations.  Well deserved!</td>', 'A really beautiful shot and I''m sure a memory that will be framed in honor of your aunt!  Congratulations.  Well deserved!', '2009-09-08 12:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
