(5640459, 818405, 70, '<td valign="top">Sure, it was this one.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=819999" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/70/120/819999.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/70/120/819999.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/70/120/819999.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Sure, it was this one. ', '2009-09-08 12:41:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640463, 811833, 52500, '<td valign="top">Just stumbled across this one again and figured I''d give you my 2 cents.  First, unless you have a really good or really bad image, during the challenge is the worst time to get comments.  If you want to know why people didn''t like it, start a thread after the challenge and ask.  Pretty easy, actually.  "Guess I''ll never know" certainly won''t get you there.  Personally, I''ve seen the same kind of shot enough now that it just isn''t that interesting to me anymore.  I would have given it a 5 if it was full size.  As is, I gave it a 3.</td>', 'Just stumbled across this one again and figured I''d give you my 2 cents.  First, unless you have a really good or really bad image, during the challenge is the worst time to get comments.  If you want to know why people didn''t like it, start a thread after the challenge and ask.  Pretty easy, actually.  "Guess I''ll never know" certainly won''t get you there.  Personally, I''ve seen the same kind of shot enough now that it just isn''t that interesting to me anymore.  I would have given it a 5 if it was full size.  As is, I gave it a 3.', '2009-09-08 12:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
