(5640525, 818296, 27482, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RulerZigzag:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow..., I hope she got paid good money for this, rubber boots or not, that water must have been exactly that, great dreamy scene, hope to see some details on this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nah, this was actually her idea, to do a photoshoot at this location and we discussed her getting into the water before even leaving that day so she knew what she was getting into.  Besides, I don´t pay people to model for me, it´s the other way around.</td>', 'Originally posted by RulerZigzag: Wow..., I hope she got paid good money for this, rubber boots or not, that water must have been exactly that, great dreamy scene, hope to see some details on this.   Nah, this was actually her idea, to do a photoshoot at this location and we discussed her getting into the water before even leaving that day so she knew what she was getting into.  Besides, I don´t pay people to model for me, it´s the other way around.', '2009-09-08 13:55:57.000000', NULL, 0),
