(5640558, 818503, 109583, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  The image is dark and moody by itself, so doesn''t need an overwrought title, imho.</td>', 'Very nice image.  The image is dark and moody by itself, so doesn''t need an overwrought title, imho.', '2009-09-08 14:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640561, 817276, 29748, '<td valign="top">I would also agree Free Studies are hard.  There are so many dynamic photos.  This one would have scored better with a tighter crop and more emphasis on the boat.  To me the shoreline is distant and busy.  This just does not really grab my attention since it appears so "cluttered". Please remember it is only my opinion.</td>', 'I would also agree Free Studies are hard.  There are so many dynamic photos.  This one would have scored better with a tighter crop and more emphasis on the boat.  To me the shoreline is distant and busy.  This just does not really grab my attention since it appears so "cluttered". Please remember it is only my opinion.', '2009-09-08 14:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640562, 818318, 109583, '<td valign="top">I love the way it looks as if it''s a drawing or lithograph or something like that.  I also find it disturbing, and that makes it a much better, more interesting photograph.</td>', 'I love the way it looks as if it''s a drawing or lithograph or something like that.  I also find it disturbing, and that makes it a much better, more interesting photograph.', '2009-09-08 14:35:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640564, 818370, 109583, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Much more interesting than all the usual suspects.</td>', 'Excellent!  Much more interesting than all the usual suspects.', '2009-09-08 14:37:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640581, 816535, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sometimes plain backgrounds work, sometimes not as well.  Her foot on the left side of the picture appears to be floating, not set on anything, which is rather awkward to say the least.  Almost sees as though she''s about to get up to get away from something we can''t see.  The right side almost appears as though she''s pasted on to the background.  Perhaps just not enough is grounded here, or not enough context, and it appears to be a shot that needs to be pasted onto something else to give it balance?</td>', 'Sometimes plain backgrounds work, sometimes not as well.  Her foot on the left side of the picture appears to be floating, not set on anything, which is rather awkward to say the least.  Almost sees as though she''s about to get up to get away from something we can''t see.  The right side almost appears as though she''s pasted on to the background.  Perhaps just not enough is grounded here, or not enough context, and it appears to be a shot that needs to be pasted onto something else to give it balance?', '2009-09-08 15:27:53.000000', NULL, 0),
