(5640835, 815224, 50695, '<td valign="top">If she''d taken off her glasses, this would''ve gotten a posthumous ribbon (not because I don''t like glasses but because it would have been even harder to recognize the forms). Not that you need more posthumous ribbons. They''re probably clogging the drain already.</td>', 'If she''d taken off her glasses, this would''ve gotten a posthumous ribbon (not because I don''t like glasses but because it would have been even harder to recognize the forms). Not that you need more posthumous ribbons. They''re probably clogging the drain already.', '2009-09-08 20:19:04.000000', NULL, 0),
