(5641545, 817520, 101117, '<td valign="top">I just came across this, it''s the first time I saw it and I think it''s an amazing shot! Had I voted on this I would probably have given it an 8 or 9, with the only points deducted for being the slightly weird distorted look on the upper left hand side.<br/> <br/>I love the framing and the expression on the face is great, there''s a good mix of cute with the ferocity of him eating at the same time.<br/> <br/>I think you probably knew when you entered this it would score low, but I''m surprised you didn''t get more comments on it!</td>', 'I just came across this, it''s the first time I saw it and I think it''s an amazing shot! Had I voted on this I would probably have given it an 8 or 9, with the only points deducted for being the slightly weird distorted look on the upper left hand side. I love the framing and the expression on the face is great, there''s a good mix of cute with the ferocity of him eating at the same time. I think you probably knew when you entered this it would score low, but I''m surprised you didn''t get more comments on it!', '2009-09-09 06:46:06.000000', NULL, 0),
