(5641722, 817235, 24454, '<td valign="top">I hope the tide is turning to a more artistic look at dpChallenge -- but THIS -- this is just an all-around fabulous photo no matter WHO is looking at it.  Congratulations on all your yellows  :)  In a free study, that means it would turn blue in any other challenge :)</td>', 'I hope the tide is turning to a more artistic look at dpChallenge -- but THIS -- this is just an all-around fabulous photo no matter WHO is looking at it.  Congratulations on all your yellows  :)  In a free study, that means it would turn blue in any other challenge :)', '2009-09-09 10:11:42.000000', NULL, 0),
