(5643059, 817735, 70369, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dirt_Diver:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow that is an amazing processing job you did. I''m really amazed that you were able to pull out this beautiful image from such a snapshot style shot. This should have finished much higher than a 6.29. <br/> <br/>BTW you have your 18-70 listed as the lens you took this with, :) But I''m glad you like the lens. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you !!!!!!!!!! <br/> <br/>I hadn''t updated my "list" of lenses yet when I entered this image, so I had to just pick one.. I totally meant to come back &amp; fix that, but completely forgot.. Thx for telling me !!!</td>', 'Originally posted by Dirt_Diver: Wow that is an amazing processing job you did. I''m really amazed that you were able to pull out this beautiful image from such a snapshot style shot. This should have finished much higher than a 6.29.  BTW you have your 18-70 listed as the lens you took this with, :) But I''m glad you like the lens.   Thank you !!!!!!!!!!  I hadn''t updated my "list" of lenses yet when I entered this image, so I had to just pick one.. I totally meant to come back & fix that, but completely forgot.. Thx for telling me !!!', '2009-09-10 10:32:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643060, 818296, 24454, '<td valign="top">I am truly amazed!  Not only by the dreamy exquisiteness of the photography here -- but what you model had to do to help you achieve this!  She should be appointed to knighthood!  Not to long ago, I was walking along the Pacific Coast and the cold tide came up over my feet, and I thought I was going to die before I could get out of the bitterly cold water.  It literally made my feet cramp up and feel extreme pain.  When I saw this, I imagined that what she was feeling was at least a hundred times more painful!  And she looks so easy and relaxed.  Jeeeeez.  I am in awe!  This is unforgettable art!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am truly amazed!  Not only by the dreamy exquisiteness of the photography here -- but what you model had to do to help you achieve this!  She should be appointed to knighthood!  Not to long ago, I was walking along the Pacific Coast and the cold tide came up over my feet, and I thought I was going to die before I could get out of the bitterly cold water.  It literally made my feet cramp up and feel extreme pain.  When I saw this, I imagined that what she was feeling was at least a hundred times more painful!  And she looks so easy and relaxed.  Jeeeeez.  I am in awe!  This is unforgettable art! ', '2009-09-10 10:34:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643061, 818312, 24454, '<td valign="top">I wonder if the weather there is as unpredictable as the weather on the Pacific Coast where I just returned from.  I was there a week and never had a day where a thick fog didn''t settle over the coast, so, tho I had hoped to try my hand at a shot like this -- there was nooooo way it was going to happen!  It makes me appreciate the strength of a photo like this!  It is stunning!  Congratulations on 7th place!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I wonder if the weather there is as unpredictable as the weather on the Pacific Coast where I just returned from.  I was there a week and never had a day where a thick fog didn''t settle over the coast, so, tho I had hoped to try my hand at a shot like this -- there was nooooo way it was going to happen!  It makes me appreciate the strength of a photo like this!  It is stunning!  Congratulations on 7th place! ', '2009-09-10 10:36:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643062, 817755, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I LOVE IT!  <b>LOVE</b> it!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, I LOVE IT!  LOVE it!!! ', '2009-09-10 10:36:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643091, 818337, 51269, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image !!!!</td>', 'Outstanding image !!!!', '2009-09-10 11:07:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643158, 815476, 92577, '<td valign="top">I expected this to do better but here are my thoughts while judging it:<br/>She doesn''t look comfortable in the glare of the full sun.<br/>Although she''s pretty and wearing make-up, her hair looks dishevelled.<br/>The direct sunlight is too harsh.<br/> <br/>Tips: If you buy a hairstyle magazine you will find around 500 portrait photos. This may give you inspiration for lighting and posing ideas. <br/>Try looking at the portrait gallery here at DPC. <br/>Try looking for ''outdoor portrait techniques'' on YouTube.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the future.</td>', 'I expected this to do better but here are my thoughts while judging it:She doesn''t look comfortable in the glare of the full sun.Although she''s pretty and wearing make-up, her hair looks dishevelled.The direct sunlight is too harsh. Tips: If you buy a hairstyle magazine you will find around 500 portrait photos. This may give you inspiration for lighting and posing ideas. Try looking at the portrait gallery here at DPC. Try looking for ''outdoor portrait techniques'' on YouTube. Good luck in the future.', '2009-09-10 11:53:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643173, 814069, 66384, '<td valign="top">Free Studies never do as well as we hope. :~( This is a good image though. In the challenges be careful about completely obliterating the background. It can be grounds for disqualification. But I really like that effect here. It''s almost like a bird book illustration. And the detail is excellent.</td>', 'Free Studies never do as well as we hope. :~( This is a good image though. In the challenges be careful about completely obliterating the background. It can be grounds for disqualification. But I really like that effect here. It''s almost like a bird book illustration. And the detail is excellent.', '2009-09-10 12:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643177, 818268, 101678, '<td valign="top">The bright spot to being DQ''ed is that this lovely image got the ribbon it so richly deserved!  Congrats.  It''s a stunning portrait</td>', 'The bright spot to being DQ''ed is that this lovely image got the ribbon it so richly deserved!  Congrats.  It''s a stunning portrait', '2009-09-10 12:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643179, 814069, 106349, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JuliBoc:</b></div><hr/><i> In the challenges be careful about completely obliterating the background. It can be grounds for disqualification. But I really like that effect here. It''s almost like a bird book illustration. And the detail is excellent. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I actually didn''t get rid of the background... when we were taking pictures of that little guy, one of my shots accidentally made the background extremely overexposed. I ended up liking it.</td>', 'Originally posted by JuliBoc: In the challenges be careful about completely obliterating the background. It can be grounds for disqualification. But I really like that effect here. It''s almost like a bird book illustration. And the detail is excellent.   I actually didn''t get rid of the background... when we were taking pictures of that little guy, one of my shots accidentally made the background extremely overexposed. I ended up liking it.', '2009-09-10 12:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643208, 816535, 100831, '<td valign="top">When I look more closely I really like this, but I needed to spend time. The pose is noticeably different and it''s shot and composed well. The b/w is really nice. I think 400+ free studies are hard for a picture like this one because people are looking for wow - they don''t absorb nuances and/or take the time when they''re scoring to really see what they''re looking at. <br/>Great job.</td>', 'When I look more closely I really like this, but I needed to spend time. The pose is noticeably different and it''s shot and composed well. The b/w is really nice. I think 400+ free studies are hard for a picture like this one because people are looking for wow - they don''t absorb nuances and/or take the time when they''re scoring to really see what they''re looking at. Great job.', '2009-09-10 13:49:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643224, 815450, 101678, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh, DARN, Miles!!! <b>DARN</b> !   Well, I just read thru the comments, and I''m very happy to see that you have such a great perspective on the whole DQ thing.  It really <b>IS</b> about the beauty of this phenomenal photo and what its significance is to your family.  I had a ribbon disqualified once because I unknowingly did something illegal in editing; then recently had one disqualified but it ended up getting reinstated, but I took the whole DQ process harder than you.  Can I be you when I grow up?????   :)<br/> <br/>Just keep sharing these amazing works of art with us!  We will all grow from your work! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Sandy!  Yes you can be me when you grow up :)  <br/> <br/>It''s no big deal, really.  I was thrilled with the ribbon, but easy come, easy go.  This image accomplished what I was hoping it would, so I''m really happy with it!</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Oh, DARN, Miles!!! DARN !   Well, I just read thru the comments, and I''m very happy to see that you have such a great perspective on the whole DQ thing.  It really IS about the beauty of this phenomenal photo and what its significance is to your family.  I had a ribbon disqualified once because I unknowingly did something illegal in editing; then recently had one disqualified but it ended up getting reinstated, but I took the whole DQ process harder than you.  Can I be you when I grow up?????   :) Just keep sharing these amazing works of art with us!  We will all grow from your work!   Thanks Sandy!  Yes you can be me when you grow up :)   It''s no big deal, really.  I was thrilled with the ribbon, but easy come, easy go.  This image accomplished what I was hoping it would, so I''m really happy with it!', '2009-09-10 14:00:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643244, 817974, 52843, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautifully shot and processed. Nice work!</td>', 'Wow! Beautifully shot and processed. Nice work!', '2009-09-10 14:18:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643426, 817235, 89809, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2009-09-10 18:58:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643451, 815450, 41182, '<td valign="top">I am sorry that your work was DQ''d, but let me say that among all of the outstanding work I have seen on DPChallenge, this is one of the best of the bunch IMHO.  I look forward to seeing more of your outstanding work in the future.<br/></td>', 'I am sorry that your work was DQ''d, but let me say that among all of the outstanding work I have seen on DPChallenge, this is one of the best of the bunch IMHO.  I look forward to seeing more of your outstanding work in the future.', '2009-09-10 19:35:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643467, 816739, 108395, '<td valign="top">Lovely Photo, I like the placement of the River Thames :)</td>', 'Lovely Photo, I like the placement of the River Thames :)', '2009-09-10 20:35:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643469, 818352, 103142, '<td valign="top">He''s very nice! quite hairy. I especially like the clarity in the wing...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-10 19:52:13.</i></td>', 'He''s very nice! quite hairy. I especially like the clarity in the wing...', '2009-09-10 20:36:34.000000', '2009-09-10 20:52:13.000000', 0),
(5643534, 818268, 67697, '<td valign="top">MAK - yay!  Congrats on the ribbon now.  This is truly an angelic photo  :)</td>', 'MAK - yay!  Congrats on the ribbon now.  This is truly an angelic photo  :)', '2009-09-10 21:43:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643542, 814069, 7969, '<td valign="top">i think this is my fav out of the ones you have posted so far. I like the detail, clean background and the textures of the feathers<br/>nice job</td>', 'i think this is my fav out of the ones you have posted so far. I like the detail, clean background and the textures of the feathersnice job', '2009-09-10 21:49:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643561, 818352, 7969, '<td valign="top">it is a beautiful shot, such an endangered little creature, good to see this pollinator is still working. I think the yellow and black is really nice together, works well, nice fuzzy colors. <br/>well done</td>', 'it is a beautiful shot, such an endangered little creature, good to see this pollinator is still working. I think the yellow and black is really nice together, works well, nice fuzzy colors. well done', '2009-09-10 22:10:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643563, 814912, 96957, '<td valign="top">Saudades do bairro da liberdade em SP...</td>', 'Saudades do bairro da liberdade em SP...', '2009-09-10 22:13:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643591, 817761, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club. <br/> <br/>This is one of those shots, that although it is excellent, will not score highly on DPC.  I personally gave it an 8 when in voting. Here are the reasons why. <br/> <br/>I think there needs to be a little more expression in your models eyes.  Right now they are just black holes.  A little dodging and burning in post processing would have helped here.<br/> <br/>If you are going to go to this extreme with a man in make up , it needs to be totally perfect.  The stubble n the upper lip throws this shot off as it is all different lengths. The hat is tilted, it may not seem like a big thing, but it throws the shot off adn makes it appear like your horizon is off, which will get you voted down as well. <br/> <br/>the white shirt that is showing is off from the rest of the shot with the black, it either needs to be all black or an even white undershirt. <br/> <br/>your horizon is also tilted with the shoulders, this could explain the hat as well .\<br/> <br/>With a make up artist at hand, and the affect that you where going for, which was Clock Work Orange, you really  need to make it work, and go almost overboard. Because as of right now, your colours are washed out.  I presumes that you want the focus on the eyes and the smoke, then pop those eyes, pop that smoke, use dodge and burn.<br/> <br/>Your sharpness and clarity is amazing, <br/> <br/>Well done on this shot<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.  This is one of those shots, that although it is excellent, will not score highly on DPC.  I personally gave it an 8 when in voting. Here are the reasons why.  I think there needs to be a little more expression in your models eyes.  Right now they are just black holes.  A little dodging and burning in post processing would have helped here. If you are going to go to this extreme with a man in make up , it needs to be totally perfect.  The stubble n the upper lip throws this shot off as it is all different lengths. The hat is tilted, it may not seem like a big thing, but it throws the shot off adn makes it appear like your horizon is off, which will get you voted down as well.  the white shirt that is showing is off from the rest of the shot with the black, it either needs to be all black or an even white undershirt.  your horizon is also tilted with the shoulders, this could explain the hat as well .\ With a make up artist at hand, and the affect that you where going for, which was Clock Work Orange, you really  need to make it work, and go almost overboard. Because as of right now, your colours are washed out.  I presumes that you want the focus on the eyes and the smoke, then pop those eyes, pop that smoke, use dodge and burn. Your sharpness and clarity is amazing,  Well done on this shot ', '2009-09-10 22:51:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643592, 818268, 36808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Can''t stop staring.  Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Can''t stop staring.  Well done.', '2009-09-10 22:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643593, 817235, 36808, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing!  Congrats and well done.</td>', 'Simply amazing!  Congrats and well done.', '2009-09-10 22:53:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643594, 817288, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>This is really an excellent shot, I am not sure that there is much I can add to this, your sharpness is amazing, your clarity is excellent. <br/> <br/>I think maybe pushing the contrast a little of the water and background would have made this really pop. <br/> <br/>An excellent image, well done</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.   This is really an excellent shot, I am not sure that there is much I can add to this, your sharpness is amazing, your clarity is excellent.  I think maybe pushing the contrast a little of the water and background would have made this really pop.  An excellent image, well done', '2009-09-10 22:54:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643596, 818369, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.  This is an amazing image with such clarity and depth.  YOur sharpness is excellent, the smooths on the fur is almost touchable. DOF and POV is spot on<br/> <br/>There is nothing more I can add, as I really do think that this is a wonderful nature shot</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.  This is an amazing image with such clarity and depth.  YOur sharpness is excellent, the smooths on the fur is almost touchable. DOF and POV is spot on There is nothing more I can add, as I really do think that this is a wonderful nature shot', '2009-09-10 22:56:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643599, 818257, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>this is an interesting shot. <br/> <br/>I think what hurt you in this shot, is the over saturation of the colours and your leaning towers. <br/> <br/>If you had made this black ad white, it may have had a more of an impact of the voters. It would have looked more moody and more drama added to it.  As of right now, it kinda looks like a bit flat. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.   this is an interesting shot.  I think what hurt you in this shot, is the over saturation of the colours and your leaning towers.  If you had made this black ad white, it may have had a more of an impact of the voters. It would have looked more moody and more drama added to it.  As of right now, it kinda looks like a bit flat.  ', '2009-09-10 23:01:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643604, 814496, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>Interesting shot.  You are sharp, clear, colours are good, subject reaches the rule of thirds. <br/> <br/>But as you know on DPC, if it isn''t right in your face and full of drama it will not do so well.  To be honest here, I think that for once (on DPC) you where really voted on technique, because lets face it , it is a duck standing there. <br/> <br/>So I think you should be very happy with the plaement on this shot as it is technically great. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.   Interesting shot.  You are sharp, clear, colours are good, subject reaches the rule of thirds.  But as you know on DPC, if it isn''t right in your face and full of drama it will not do so well.  To be honest here, I think that for once (on DPC) you where really voted on technique, because lets face it , it is a duck standing there.  So I think you should be very happy with the plaement on this shot as it is technically great.  ', '2009-09-10 23:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643610, 812731, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>Interesting shot, I think what is needed here is a little more contrast, you have some amazing colours going on. <br/> <br/>In post processing, I think playing around with your selective colours could have brought more depth to this shot.<br/> <br/>It really looks like a lovely place to be<br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.   Interesting shot, I think what is needed here is a little more contrast, you have some amazing colours going on.  In post processing, I think playing around with your selective colours could have brought more depth to this shot. It really looks like a lovely place to be', '2009-09-10 23:09:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643614, 812286, 87808, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting choice of blue colours? Why did you go with blue and how did you do it??</td>', 'this is an interesting choice of blue colours? Why did you go with blue and how did you do it??', '2009-09-10 23:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643615, 815288, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>This is a lovely morning shot with amazing morning ''fog''.<br/> <br/>There are a couple things that I would address though, I would play around with the contrast in your post processing as you you are a little burnt out in the right hand corner,.  you have several sun bubbles in that are really standing out that take away from the shot. <br/> <br/>A little more dodging and burning on your trees would have added depth to this shot as well .<br/> <br/>Your sharpness , and POV and DOF are excellent.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.   This is a lovely morning shot with amazing morning ''fog''. There are a couple things that I would address though, I would play around with the contrast in your post processing as you you are a little burnt out in the right hand corner,.  you have several sun bubbles in that are really standing out that take away from the shot.  A little more dodging and burning on your trees would have added depth to this shot as well . Your sharpness , and POV and DOF are excellent. ', '2009-09-10 23:13:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643618, 818504, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club. <br/> <br/>Please feel free to contact me if you have any questions. <br/> <br/>Gorgeous shot, <br/> <br/>The only thing is the little strip of blue, it is distracting from the shot.  You have done really well with this shot, with focus, sharpness and colours. <br/> <br/>Not a lot I can add, as this really is an amazing shot.</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  Please feel free to contact me if you have any questions.  Gorgeous shot,  The only thing is the little strip of blue, it is distracting from the shot.  You have done really well with this shot, with focus, sharpness and colours.  Not a lot I can add, as this really is an amazing shot.', '2009-09-10 23:21:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643634, 818352, 103601, '<td valign="top">this is a situation where the heavy border really works well</td>', 'this is a situation where the heavy border really works well', '2009-09-10 23:38:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643639, 816885, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club. <br/> <br/>what can you say about a gorgeous shot like this.  You have all the elements going on here, smooth creamy water,great saturations of colours, good sharpness good DOF. <br/> <br/>You scored well for this shot, well done, I am sorry it is not more indepth, as there is not a lot to say about it!</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  what can you say about a gorgeous shot like this.  You have all the elements going on here, smooth creamy water,great saturations of colours, good sharpness good DOF.  You scored well for this shot, well done, I am sorry it is not more indepth, as there is not a lot to say about it!', '2009-09-10 23:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643711, 818504, 108620, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the comments. The consensus critique seems to have to do with the strip of blue (not actually sky, but part of the Sangre de Cristo mountains behind the dunes). I struggled with this myself and didn''t know which was the right way to go - which makes the feedback here so interesting and valuable. I had one commenter who liked and might have preferred even more of the blue. My reasoning when taking the shot was that I loved the crisp edge to the gradient fade of the top layer of dune, and without the strip of mountain behind it, I found it much less powerful. But, I also admit it is as much distracting as it is defining. I have other shots from this session that didn''t include the mountains behind the dune and I like them less.</td>', 'Thanks to all for the comments. The consensus critique seems to have to do with the strip of blue (not actually sky, but part of the Sangre de Cristo mountains behind the dunes). I struggled with this myself and didn''t know which was the right way to go - which makes the feedback here so interesting and valuable. I had one commenter who liked and might have preferred even more of the blue. My reasoning when taking the shot was that I loved the crisp edge to the gradient fade of the top layer of dune, and without the strip of mountain behind it, I found it much less powerful. But, I also admit it is as much distracting as it is defining. I have other shots from this session that didn''t include the mountains behind the dune and I like them less.', '2009-09-11 00:44:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5644199, 816294, 109953, '<td valign="top">Beautifu!</td>', 'Beautifu!', '2009-09-11 17:17:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5644204, 815779, 109953, '<td valign="top">Beautifu!!!</td>', 'Beautifu!!!', '2009-09-11 17:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5644206, 818296, 109953, '<td valign="top">Beautifu!!</td>', 'Beautifu!!', '2009-09-11 17:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5644345, 818268, 20324, '<td valign="top">Just excellent!</td>', 'Just excellent!', '2009-09-11 19:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
