(5646968, 811833, 100335, '<td valign="top">freakin_hilarious<br/> <br/>Thanks for leaving your 2 cents, I totally respect your opinion. <br/> <br/>My opinion: Your vote was too harsh. Judging by your 35 thousand votes cast, i''m guessing you''re completely jaded from this type of shot. I''d be interested in seeing what qualifies as a 2 or a 1 for you. Also, while i do appreciate comments, I''m not that desperate for them to go off to the forums and ask for more comments. 248 views during voting and 3 comments says enough: Cliche''. I''m just frustrated considering the effort i put into this.<br/> <br/>Thanks for your 3.</td>', 'freakin_hilarious Thanks for leaving your 2 cents, I totally respect your opinion.  My opinion: Your vote was too harsh. Judging by your 35 thousand votes cast, i''m guessing you''re completely jaded from this type of shot. I''d be interested in seeing what qualifies as a 2 or a 1 for you. Also, while i do appreciate comments, I''m not that desperate for them to go off to the forums and ask for more comments. 248 views during voting and 3 comments says enough: Cliche''. I''m just frustrated considering the effort i put into this. Thanks for your 3.', '2009-09-14 18:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
