(5673662, 816597, 74559, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been here much lately, but I had to check what you''ve been doing and I''m so glad I did...I love this image of Mackenzie! The high key treatment is wonderful, but most of all I''m amazed by the beauty and composure of your little treasure...she looks so adult! Thanks for the smile, congrats on your well deserved high placement in a FS! hugz</td>', 'I haven''t been here much lately, but I had to check what you''ve been doing and I''m so glad I did...I love this image of Mackenzie! The high key treatment is wonderful, but most of all I''m amazed by the beauty and composure of your little treasure...she looks so adult! Thanks for the smile, congrats on your well deserved high placement in a FS! hugz', '2009-10-03 22:42:17.000000', NULL, 0),
